        "1028",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17c279b0dfba0beb086347b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧～嘿咻嘿咻！\r\n呵呵，还是这样喊最有干劲了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ca0e752c88865c5fc3c3618f0f83ee8ecb01f9ae8c12f2ea4876de39585673",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1db824381f30facd6ae533a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么菜色？\r\n口味重一点……嗯～炸鸡☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09c14b65895fc40ab7121ecbf0e1f5fa25c37284043135fac98764d71b7045b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e1500dcf67c0e6a7c2762c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了最棒的「相扑火锅」，\r\n我会好好努力喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "976f68e48606a9299235464275a11b1ff3971f74edf853434abc5cdd14c92aa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5519f043db21fc88f2fd4c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是睡午觉的好天气……呃，\r\n不行不行。我得好好努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "085bd51c63cf91f47b1596df46f9002f0043e61d7b666091e601a82ee9aa43d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b83713b313f04ff065d2826f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像没什么精神呢……\r\n明明我都有好好吃饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a7bcaa1caa4f0ddc47d83a9b19aba15d4a7c0cc2a5e43b3f5c3c8f3db743964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a2a268a655d3203eba8b8aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……今天的早餐好像\r\n不怎么buono呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d922df8ed1ae80c6ea81e5328c7eb64c27d9f5c5e01da8c4fc7b4c1922ea5317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b2c06866900cb26b2b11f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不行啊～想要让大家\r\n露出笑容，我自己得先\r\n面带笑容才行～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8f5b6d3b9030c8bbba8c422e5747a4b2053e081f8b1f51557f1de02bee4d6cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e02e51a65cceac00832221f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，比赛续摊～？\r\n唔……我好像有点累了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4e7b9cf922f05a128e96865e1cef6cf508fd0efb37152dd889aab62db6142b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:097bb62b7de5cb57f8df0168",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛已经很够了～\r\n……继续下去的话，\r\n感觉就跟buono渐行渐远咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "60dcaaf60766b1d5565656693c55d3dbf5e787442c7996882eb91cb448ff8f5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b842844897c879238433713",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照这个状态下去，巨大胜利就在眼前！\r\n那我就收下咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7d597c51beb2e250276b99c3809ba7f755c00ae07e91bcbe631ff38a066a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54000d4e052a9c38e5bc4fd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以火锅来比喻，像是火锅料跟汤头\r\n都准备好了吧～☆就只剩下……\r\n把火转开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba7a972c518f214d329884b8bcfdd5dd25318da60290071daa20dc4b698171a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d363486b934c9ba2d7de7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻嘿～咻！\r\n呵呵，我会让大家看到\r\n热血沸腾的较量喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8911f52f8ec4cff4a3cb8c5cf5e6801494615b7787d5fc33d555454faf5a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6f1c7b1415b0e3b8777ef5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能感觉到巨大的力量\r\n在体内打转喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "199c56938700bd0867b2659a7dde467b997e54066e88250cd0337fe29f5a1885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92d8a65e657f2b799d0f168e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，状态很好～！\r\n事前准备无懈可击☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ee509f091b8e478d3b0765478b8d98bc7141988406b55059ca1d273cf8f11a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e74d85d01fab104497a3e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态buono buono♪\r\n看来能够大大活跃咯～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ba7cb8c84f322a2248c9d434e89fd9ec587283137bcfee0aee7ccbac1abd301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7125deccd1807ced7ca2c68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让大家都感受到buono，\r\n我会竭尽全力加油喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b536087fc2bfd3bd37bb82711e451373e22d24d51c181cae90053572caae215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19454145ca7d3dd55aa4fe27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了～差不多要上场了呢。\r\n我一定也会让训练员\r\n感到满意喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3fd0c794fe34fc87809f45c2fef0bc3039c97e2b7172ccc28078b869af9234e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c93a0bfa6a43840b35920699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直在思考要招待大家\r\n什么料理～当然是在\r\n我获胜之后啰♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd903bb26e6aaf91670b80bad957ab46b01794b751cfdf7f3b4b75ec1fa9df73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:965e009773f1443c16216e4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让大家都buono，\r\n我一直都很努力。\r\n总不能让人失望嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb06165a80e7fde6574a553ee65afd430b9d98c86e0df2d51001698487092acf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1626a93c50b84ab00d6c77fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最重要的是使尽全力较量。\r\n不管状态如何，唯独这一点\r\n我绝不妥协～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b82ab4be0a255abb122fe88ded67fb459d406c7cd887e775cf77e44740d0cea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a821aca34491360cb8762bc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许有点困难，\r\n但不要紧喔。我会让大家见识到\r\n我在紧要关头时的策略～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4fc04d2c1cf1bc0164283b328282f46bdede7b63019941b9559df9b50ba703c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69bcbb80623f012bb60d00be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我能成为\r\n「相扑火锅」吗……不用怀疑，\r\n我一定会成功的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb90b8cb33e29604840644b1ed966df3302b8a1cb5bee07f056f3248b790d17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d521fe1299e37bd4f7d1e12a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，现在要好好加油～\r\n毕竟希望能让一路拼命努力的\r\n大家感到满意嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f436c339e4298119078c09a7b3ded89a102da51add5ce5742d6394dffbc67f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8224aecd55b4a5d58b535e1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子明明不饿，\r\n却没什么力气……\r\n不知道能不能好好使出全力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a347784d6eb054f4fec8a7aa675d3065373f44042a1a274d2e0825ce95343c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810e397d05abed13f18200f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出～发了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ef3aa7a740ddfabb913e8dd7cf6eaa3f2febddad62f0b0ec2a6ff81ad6eb6b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49236bbf4528eb3539f62de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好期待喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdfe1233c9f54c5abc41649ee8b8c42de45a71b460caff3d84a5ce575a7dcb02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e61d12e52d30b62a883de84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要加油喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d268f2be9a60acd784178cac9b3cce86bbf98b888c176b65a4054b81d2853221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f09e0703a0fd6a91675b2183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要变聪明～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1a0f5df480aec14ef5b258686434884104940146cf39ca66101025bdc09084",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdfa9113ef2beaf93df2f66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddf70ff90859abdbd9bda610636241432a039aa13a920fedf7c109ff789700f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed47709029646108daa4584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？不对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd745557bcf9e6ce6a712059442757bc12aa90233f2c4492d30f836966a8cd15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
